   TLA /T-L-A/ n.
   
   [Three-Letter Acronym] 1. Self-describing abbreviation for a species
   with which computing terminology is infested. 2. Any confusing
   acronym. Examples include MCA, FTP, SNA, CPU, MMU, SCCS, DMU, FPU,
